id: pm-8jzcwv
title: Align token-budget recovery declaration states with the public runtime guard
description: "Final PR1508 full review identifies a new declaration-contract gap: the broad PmTokenBudgetRecovery interface permits null or inconsistent status-dependent fields that isPmTokenBudgetRecovery rejects. Express its three states as a discriminated union, preserving runtime validation of positive safe integers and equal exact budgets."
type: Task
status: closed
priority: 2
tags[3]: bug,sdk,types
created_at: "2026-10-19T22:21:25.931Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-19T22:27:27.911Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-19T22:26:56.464Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-19T22:26:56.464Z"
author: "harness:codex"
acceptance_criteria: Compile-time negative controls reject impossible status-dependent fields before runtime; all three legal variants and status narrowing remain usable through public root/core entrypoints; runtime validator and emitted JavaScript behavior are preserved; public-surface snapshot and four TypeScript projects pass
parent: pm-f05lsg
resolution: "Replace the broad recovery interface with a status-discriminated union: exact and feasible-only advice require numeric feasible budgets; only exact has a numeric minimum; unavailable requires null budgets and a cause. Preserve runtime numeric validation and whitelisted projection, document narrowing and acknowledge the two new public declaration signatures."
expected_result: "Package producers reject nine inconsistent state shapes at compile time, consumers narrow valid variants through public root/core imports, and runtime behavior remains unchanged."
actual_result: The isolated pre-fix public declaration control fails with nine unused expected-error directives and three failed narrowing assignments. Afterward all four TypeScript projects and189 linked runtime cases pass; the same type controls pass in a freshly packed installed consumer. Strict lint contracts SDK snapshot docs links graph and record checks pass. Comment-free JavaScript for the three touched source files is identical to native-accepted dd097e4e1. Revised-head hosted validation and review remain delivery gates.
